    "name": "Diamo XL",
    "steam_appid": 715010,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/978f88d5c8012217906056b0ec583cbb.poster.avif?t=1745903701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/978f88d5c8012217906056b0ec583cbb.webm?t=1745903701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/978f88d5c8012217906056b0ec583cbb.mp4?t=1745903701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diamo XL</strong> is a fast-paced, arcade-style score chaser where survival means constantly moving and adapting. Navigate all zones around the diamond, collect points before enemies destroy them, and don't stop moving to maintain your multiplier for high scores. Fill in all four triangles to complete the diamond and earn bonus points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/00c381fd3a306cee690824cc4c49ef53.poster.avif?t=1745903701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/00c381fd3a306cee690824cc4c49ef53.webm?t=1745903701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/00c381fd3a306cee690824cc4c49ef53.mp4?t=1745903701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple &amp; Intuitive Controls</strong> \u2013 Play using keyboard (Arrow Keys/WASD), controller (D-Pad/Joystick), or mouse clicks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-Paced Arcade Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Endless action that ramps up in difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockable Characters</strong> \u2013 Complete challenges to play as unique characters with different stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Score Tracking &amp; Multipliers</strong> \u2013 Improve and perfect your high score strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Integration</strong> \u2013 Achievements, Leaderboards, Trading Cards, Cloud Saves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bite-Sized &amp; Addictive</strong> \u2013 Perfect for quick sessions between other games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uniquely Crafted Audio</strong> \u2013 Sound effects made using my own voice and royalty-free audio and\u00a0Royalty Free Music from Bensound called &quot;Moose&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/275435c6dec6b8c5b04fadf6674a28a5.poster.avif?t=1745903701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/275435c6dec6b8c5b04fadf6674a28a5.webm?t=1745903701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/275435c6dec6b8c5b04fadf6674a28a5.mp4?t=1745903701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diamo XL is a simple yet rewarding arcade game focused on high scores and replayability. I appreciate all feedback and will continue supporting the game. Feel free to reach out via Discord or my website if you have suggestions or want to say hi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks for checking it out, I hope you enjoy playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adam Nickerson \u2013 Adamvision Studios</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/978f88d5c8012217906056b0ec583cbb.poster.avif?t=1745903701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/978f88d5c8012217906056b0ec583cbb.webm?t=1745903701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/978f88d5c8012217906056b0ec583cbb.mp4?t=1745903701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diamo XL</strong> is a fast-paced, arcade-style score chaser where survival means constantly moving and adapting. Navigate all zones around the diamond, collect points before enemies destroy them, and don't stop moving to maintain your multiplier for high scores. Fill in all four triangles to complete the diamond and earn bonus points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/00c381fd3a306cee690824cc4c49ef53.poster.avif?t=1745903701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/00c381fd3a306cee690824cc4c49ef53.webm?t=1745903701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/00c381fd3a306cee690824cc4c49ef53.mp4?t=1745903701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple &amp; Intuitive Controls</strong> \u2013 Play using keyboard (Arrow Keys/WASD), controller (D-Pad/Joystick), or mouse clicks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-Paced Arcade Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Endless action that ramps up in difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockable Characters</strong> \u2013 Complete challenges to play as unique characters with different stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Score Tracking &amp; Multipliers</strong> \u2013 Improve and perfect your high score strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Integration</strong> \u2013 Achievements, Leaderboards, Trading Cards, Cloud Saves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bite-Sized &amp; Addictive</strong> \u2013 Perfect for quick sessions between other games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uniquely Crafted Audio</strong> \u2013 Sound effects made using my own voice and royalty-free audio and\u00a0Royalty Free Music from Bensound called &quot;Moose&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/275435c6dec6b8c5b04fadf6674a28a5.poster.avif?t=1745903701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/275435c6dec6b8c5b04fadf6674a28a5.webm?t=1745903701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715010/extras/275435c6dec6b8c5b04fadf6674a28a5.mp4?t=1745903701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diamo XL is a simple yet rewarding arcade game focused on high scores and replayability. I appreciate all feedback and will continue supporting the game. Feel free to reach out via Discord or my website if you have suggestions or want to say hi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks for checking it out, I hope you enjoy playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adam Nickerson \u2013 Adamvision Studios</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Diamo XL is a fast-paced, addictive, and challenging arcade score chaser. Dodge obstacles, rack up high scores, and master precise movement. Easy to learn but tough to master, it's perfect for quick sessions or leaderboard dominance. Play while waiting in queue or push for endless high-score glory!",
